    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ source file with implementations for the µTest++ deferred reporter methods. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This source file contains the implementation of the <computeroutput>detail::deferred_reporter_base</computeroutput> class, which supports deferred reporting of test expression results. The constructor captures the result value, source location, and subtest reference; the destructor updates the subtest counters and optionally aborts execution on critical failures.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus::detail</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file must be included when building the µTest++ library. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
